:: Fishing Beach Cat Eat Party
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.partyFeed to "declined">>
The teens by the campfire go silent as they watch you drop the whole <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> in your mouth. <<fishingEatFishTfProgress>><<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Beach Party Fish Cook
<<effects>>
You carry the <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> over to the teens by the fire. They whoop as one of them pulls out a knife and cleans it as best they can. In a few minutes, it's sizzling over the flames.
<br><br>

요리가 완성되자 당신과 다른 사람들은 그것을 게걸스럽게 뜯어먹는다. 지저분하고, 연기가 나고, 모래가 약간 씹히지만, 맛은 훌륭하다.<<stress -12>><<llstress>><<status 25>><<ggcool>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다시 낚시한다|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[근처에 남는다|Beach Party]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Throw Back Party
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.partyFeed to "declined">>
You toss the <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> back into the sea, ignoring the groans and jeers that rise from the campfire behind you.
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Keep Party
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.partyFeed to "declined">>
You stow the <<= fishDisplayName(fishKeepKey($fishingHookedFish))>> away, ignoring the groans and jeers that rise from the campfire behind you.
<<run fishStow($fishingHookedFish)>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>



:: Widgets Fishing Beach Campfire Party [widget]
<<widget "fishingWaitAmbientCampfireParty">>
	<<addinlineevent 3>>
		캠프파이어에서 연기 냄새가 풍겨오는 것을 느낀다.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 3>>
		캠프파이어에서 웃음소리가 들려온다.
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</widget>>
